# What git should NOT track. This repo tracks CODE + small text/config only; large
# research data and regenerable outputs are skipped so history stays fast and clean.
# (Trading data, runtime state, and the venv already live on local C:\TradingDesk-Local,
# outside this Drive folder, so they're not here to begin with.)

# --- Python build/cache ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Generated reports / outputs (regenerable; large) ---
backtester/output/
*.html

# --- Research data & binaries (not code) ---
*.pdf
*.parquet
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.zip
*.png
*.jpg

# --- Local tooling / editor ---
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
